<title>POLAND: OKOCIM JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.56 vs   4.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.45 vs   9.22</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.40 vs   6.75</p>
<p> Sales		   34.66 vs  29.41</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    12.15 vs  13.77</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	23.70 vs  25.08</p>
<p> Operating profit    17.08 vs  23.86</p>
<p> Sales		  157.41 vs 108.19</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Okocim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
